@bartloop According to the changes we introduced in #4709:
- [AsyncResult.forget()](https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/4709/files#diff-accb7090ee45fffb2262cbceeabef002R249) will also unsubscribe
- You can use `ignore_result` as a task execution option directly in [apply_async / delay methods](https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/4709/files#diff-a4622e17daa3bfaf3dc55dbd6b35ced7)
